38,2,1,talk,Yumi,,Last winter's outage was unowned for two days. The scope changed twice.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,We skipped three upgrades because testing took too long. The 2018 data lift was bad.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
