45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,We need a vendor who stays on site during rollout.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Kenji,,We need something that works with our old scanners.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"We need a fixed price, not a subscription that grows.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Yumi,,We need clear ownership of support from day one.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,We need a system that doesn't require weeks of testing to update.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
